{"id":619,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"理数を重視し豊富な行事で社会性を育成","feature_description":"開明中学校は数学・理科の素養を重視し、文系・理系を問わず情報化社会に対応する力を育てます。週37単位の授業と、約2か月に3回を目安とする多彩な行事を教育の柱に掲げています。理科実習や歴史探訪、弁論大会など、生徒と教員が準備・運営する機会を設け、学習やクラブ活動を通じて社会性、国際的な視野、思いやりの心、生活習慣を育む方針です。","clubs":[{"id":11598,"name":"生物部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11599,"name":"将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11600,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11601,"name":"ＥＳＳ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11602,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11603,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11604,"name":"家庭科部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11605,"name":"クラシック音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11606,"name":"かるた部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11607,"name":"クイズ研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11608,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11609,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11610,"name":"インターアクト部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11614,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_jhs","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":11615,"name":"物理部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ka